---
import { readingPreferences } from '../utils/reading-preferences';
import '../styles/reading-settings.css';
---
<div class="reading-settings-entry" data-pagefind-ignore>
  <span class="reading-settings-summary">18px · 寬鬆行距</span>
  <button type="button" class="reading-settings-trigger" data-reading-settings aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-controls="reading-settings" aria-expanded="false" hidden>閱讀設定</button>
</div>
<dialog id="reading-settings" aria-labelledby="reading-settings-title" data-pagefind-ignore>
  <div class="reading-settings-head">
    <h2 id="reading-settings-title">閱讀設定</h2>
    <button type="button" data-reading-settings-close autofocus>關閉</button>
  </div>
  <div class="reading-settings-body">
    <section class="reading-preview" aria-label="閱讀排版預覽" tabindex="0">
      <p class="reading-preview-caption">排版預覽 · 示範文字（可捲動）</p>
      <div class="reading-preview-text">
        <h3>檔案與目錄</h3>
        <p>Linux 以一棵從根目錄 <code>/</code> 開始的樹狀結構組織檔案。目錄用來整理檔案，也可以包含其他目錄。</p>
        <pre><code>pwd
ls -la /home</code></pre>
      </div>
    </section>
    <div class="reading-settings-controls">
      <label for="reading-font-size">字體大小</label>
      <div class="reading-size-row">
        <input id="reading-font-size" type="range" min={readingPreferences.sizes[0]} max={readingPreferences.sizes.at(-1)} step="2" value={readingPreferences.defaults.size} aria-describedby="reading-font-size-hint" />
        <output for="reading-font-size" id="reading-size-output">18px</output>
      </div>
      <p id="reading-font-size-hint" class="reading-settings-hint">16、18、20、22px；隨瀏覽器文字大小縮放。</p>
      <label for="reading-line-height">行距</label>
      <select id="reading-line-height">
        <option value="1.7">標準 · 1.7</option>
        <option value="1.8" selected>寬鬆 · 1.8</option>
      </select>
      <label for="reading-column-width">桌面欄寬</label>
      <select id="reading-column-width" aria-describedby="reading-width-hint">
        <option value="680">標準 · 680px</option>
        <option value="800">寬版 · 800px</option>
      </select>
      <p class="reading-settings-hint" id="reading-width-hint">欄寬套用於背景文章；此處預覽字級與行距。手機正文自動配合螢幕。</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="reading-settings-actions">
    <button type="button" id="reading-settings-reset">還原預設</button>
    <button type="button" data-reading-settings-close>完成</button>
  </div>
  <p class="reading-settings-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
</dialog>
<script>
  import '../scripts/reading-settings';
</script>
